<comment pinned="false">Branch 8-10 very high: Flash and fast beep until A is pressed, sunscreen as
above plus hat and shade, then start the 2 hour reapply timer.
Alerts again if the wearer only had the moderate / high advice so far.
No answer within alertGiveUpMinutes means standby, as above.</comment>
</block>
