<comment pinned="false">Flash all the LEDs and beep until A is pressed (or the app sends "ack").
fast = true is the quicker, higher beep for very high UV.
Gives up after alertGiveUpMinutes so a device left on a table does not beep
all day; the caller then goes to standby.</comment>
</block>
